  "cnD": "地空地劫是紫微斗数中最容易被误解的煞曜。很多人一看到空劫就断「破财」「空忙一场」，实际上空劫的本质是「非常规」——它打破常规路径，让人不按常理出牌。用好了是灵感和突破，用不好才是耗散和落空。",
  "enD": "Di Kong and Di Jie are the most misunderstood malefics in Zi Wei Dou Shu. Many people see them and immediately conclude \"wealth loss\" or \"effort in vain,\" but their essence is \"unconventionality\"—they break常规 paths and make people play outside the rules. Used well, they bring inspiration and breakthrough; used poorly, they bring dissipation and futility.",
  "cnL": "地空主「空」——想法多、灵感强、不切实际、对物质看得淡。地劫主「劫」——突发的变动、意料之外的损耗、打破既定计划。两颗星经常一起出现，合称「空劫」。空劫在命宫的人，思维跳跃、不循常规，适合做创意、艺术、研发、独立策划，但不适合做需要严格按流程执行的工作。空劫在财帛宫，不是一定破财，而是「赚钱方式非常规」——可能靠灵感、创意、突发机会赚钱，但也容易因为不切实际的投资而亏损。空劫在官禄宫，工作容易变动、不喜欢稳定的体制内，适合自由职业、创业、项目制工作。空劫在夫妻宫，感情容易有「意想不到」的变化——可能是闪婚闪离，也可能是遇到和预期完全不同的伴侣。空劫的关键是「顺势而为」。它的能量不适合被压抑，越压抑越容易以「突发变故」的形式爆发。适合的方式是给空劫一个合法的出口：创意工作、学习新事物、定期改变生活节奏。同时需要「落地机制」——把空劫的灵感写下来、找务实的人合作、设定执行截止日，避免「想得多做得少」。",
  "enL": "Di Kong governs \"void\"—many ideas, strong inspiration, impracticality, indifference to material things. Di Jie governs \"calamity\"—sudden changes, unexpected losses, breaking established plans. The two often appear together, called \"Kong Jie.\" Kong Jie in Life Palace: jumping thinking, unconventional, suitable for creative, artistic, R&D, independent planning, but not for work requiring strict process execution. Kong Jie in Wealth Palace: not necessarily wealth loss, but \"unconventional earning methods\"—may earn through inspiration, creativity, sudden opportunities, but also easily loses through impractical investments. Kong Jie in Career Palace: work tends to change, dislikes stable institutional jobs, suitable for freelancing, entrepreneurship, project-based work. Kong Jie in Spouse Palace: relationships prone to \"unexpected\" changes—may be flash marriage and divorce, or meeting a partner completely different from expectations. The key with Kong Jie is \"going with the flow.\" Its energy should not be suppressed; the more suppressed, the more likely it erupts as \"sudden misfortune.\" The suitable approach is to give Kong Jie a legitimate outlet: creative work, learning new things, regularly changing life rhythm. At the same time, need a \"grounding mechanism\"—write down inspirations, collaborate with pragmatic people, set execution deadlines, avoid \"thinking much, doing little.\"",
