  "enA": "Practical case: Someone with Di Kong/Di Jie in Life Palace has jumping thinking, does not play by the rules, may be seen as \"weird\" in traditional workplaces, but in creative, R&D, entrepreneurship and other fields that require breaking conventions, they can stand out. The key is finding an environment that can accommodate this trait.",
