  "cnD": "火星和铃星是六煞中的「火」属性星曜，主急躁、爆发、冲突。但两者的表现形式不同：火星是「明火烧」——来得快去得快，当场发作但不记仇；铃星是「暗火闷」——表面不发作但心里记着，容易积累成怨气。管理火铃的关键不是「不生气」，而是「让火气有正确的出口」。",
  "enD": "Huo Xing and Ling Xing are the \"fire\" attribute malefics among the six baleful stars, governing impatience, explosion, and conflict. But they manifest differently: Huo Xing is \"open fire\"—comes fast, goes fast, erupts on the spot but holds no grudge; Ling Xing is \"smoldering fire\"—does not erupt on the surface but keeps it inside, easily accumulating into resentment. The key to managing them is not \"never get angry\" but \"giving fire energy the right outlet.\"",
  "cnL": "火星的特征：急性子、反应快、有爆发力、做事雷厉风行。优点是执行力强、不拖泥带水；缺点是容易冲动、说话伤人、事后后悔。铃星的特征：隐忍、多疑、暗中较劲、耐力强。优点是能坚持、有暗劲、适合做需要长期坚持的事；缺点是容易记仇、内心戏多、突然爆发时破坏力大。火铃在不同宫位的表现：在命宫，性格急躁或闷骚，容易因小事发火。在财帛宫，赚钱方式偏「短线、投机、快进快出」，容易因冲动投资亏损。在官禄宫，工作风格强势、效率高，但容易和同事上级冲突。在夫妻宫，感情中容易吵架——火星型是当场吵完就好，铃星型是冷战后翻旧账。火铃夹命是一个特殊格局：火星铃星在命宫的相邻两宫（夹命），命宫被两团火夹击。这类人性格极度急躁，一生多波折，但如果命宫主星强（如紫微、武曲、七杀），能把火铃的能量转化为极强的执行力和爆发力，适合做需要冲劲的工作（销售、创业、竞技）。如果命宫主星弱（如天同、太阴），火铃夹命就容易变成情绪失控、健康问题（心血管、上火）。火铃的管理方法：火星型需要「延迟反应」——生气时数三秒再说话，把爆发力用在运动和工作上。铃星型需要「及时表达」——有不满就说出来，不要闷在心里积累，定期找渠道释放情绪。",
  "enL": "Huo Xing characteristics: short temper, fast reactions, explosive, decisive. Advantages: strong execution, no dragging feet; disadvantages: impulsive, says hurtful things, regrets afterward. Ling Xing characteristics: forbearing, suspicious, secretly competing, strong endurance. Advantages: persistent, has hidden strength, suitable for long-term endeavors; disadvantages: holds grudges, much inner drama, destructive when finally erupting. Manifestations by palace: in Life Palace, impatient or brooding personality, easily angered by small things. In Wealth Palace, earning style leans \"short-term, speculative, fast in fast out,\" easily loses from impulsive investments. In Career Palace, strong work style, high efficiency, but easily conflicts with colleagues and superiors. In Spouse Palace, relationships prone to arguments—Huo Xing type argues and gets over it, Ling Xing type cold-wars then brings up old scores. Huo-Ling clamping Life Palace is a special pattern: Huo Xing and Ling Xing in the two adjacent palaces of Life Palace, clamping it. These people have extremely impatient personalities, many life twists, but if the Life Palace major star is strong (Zi Wei, Wu Qu, Qi Sha), they can convert Huo-Ling energy into extreme execution and explosiveness, suitable for work requiring drive (sales, entrepreneurship, athletics). If the major star is weak (Tian Tong, Tai Yin), Huo-Ling clamping easily becomes emotional instability and health problems (cardiovascular, inflammation). Management methods: Huo Xing type needs \"delayed response\"—count three seconds before speaking when angry, channel explosiveness into sports and work. Ling Xing type needs \"timely expression\"—speak up when dissatisfied, do not闷 it inside and accumulate, regularly find outlets to release emotions.",
