  "focus": "职业倦怠的命盘信号：福德宫与官禄宫的耗竭结构。重点讲职业倦怠的识别、不同命盘结构的倦怠原因，以及如何在倦怠期做调整而非硬撑。",
  "focusEn": "Chart signals of occupational burnout: depletion structures between Fortune and Career palaces. This covers identifying burnout, causes by different chart structures, and how to adjust during burnout rather than forcing through.",
  "cnT": "紫微斗数看职业倦怠：福德宫官禄宫的耗竭信号与恢复方法",
  "enT": "Occupational Burnout in Zi Wei Dou Shu: Fortune and Career Palace Depletion Signals",
  "cnD": "职业倦怠不是简单的「累」，而是长期能量耗竭后的身心状态。从命盘看，职业倦怠通常和福德宫（内在满足感）与官禄宫（工作投入）之间的失衡有关——官禄宫投入太多，福德宫得不到滋养，时间长了就会耗竭。",
  "enD": "Occupational burnout is not simply \"tiredness,\" but a physical and mental state after long-term energy depletion. From the chart perspective, burnout is usually related to imbalance between the Fortune Palace (inner fulfillment) and Career Palace (work investment)—too much investment in Career, too little nourishment in Fortune, leading to depletion over time.",
  "cnL": "职业倦怠的命盘信号：第一，官禄宫煞星多（擎羊、陀罗、火星、铃星、地空、地劫）而福德宫无吉星化解——工作中持续承受压力，但内在没有恢复机制。第二，官禄宫化忌或大限化忌入官禄——工作领域成为长期课题，努力但看不到回报。第三，福德宫化忌或煞星重——内在满足感低，即使工作顺利也不开心。第四，命宫和官禄宫之间没有「能量回流」——工作不能带来成就感，纯粹是消耗。不同命盘结构的倦怠原因：命宫紫微/武曲（强势型）的倦怠，通常是「什么都想自己扛、不授权」导致的耗竭。命宫天机/太阴（思虑型）的倦怠，通常是「想太多、精神内耗」导致的。命宫贪狼/破军（变动型）的倦怠，通常是「重复工作让欲望得不到满足」导致的。命宫天同/天梁（安稳型）的倦怠，通常是「被迫做不喜欢的事、失去舒适区」导致的。职业倦怠期的调整方法：首先是「识别信号」——持续失眠、对工作失去兴趣、身体出现不明原因的不适，这些都是倦怠的警告，不要硬撑。其次是「能量补给」——福德宫对应的领域（兴趣、休息、社交、精神追求）需要主动投入时间，不能等有空了才休息。第三是「工作重构」——如果倦怠来自工作内容本身，考虑在大限流年的转换期调整方向（换岗、转行、减少工作量）。第四是「寻求支持」——福德宫也代表精神寄托，有信仰、爱好、密友的人更容易从倦怠中恢复。",
  "enL": "Chart signals of occupational burnout: first, Career Palace has many malefics (Qing Yang, Tuo Lo, Huo Xing, Ling Xing, Di Kong, Di Jie) while Fortune Palace lacks auspicious stars to resolve—sustained pressure at work without internal recovery mechanism. Second, Career Palace has Jealousy or Decade Jealousy enters Career—work becomes a long-term lesson, effort without visible return. Third, Fortune Palace has Jealousy or heavy malefics—low inner fulfillment, unhappy even when work goes well. Fourth, no \"energy return flow\" between Life and Career palaces—work does not bring achievement, purely消耗. Burnout causes by chart structure: Life Palace Zi Wei/Wu Qu (strong type) burnout usually from \"wanting to carry everything, not delegating.\" Life Palace Ji Ji/Tai Yin (thoughtful type) burnout usually from \"overthinking, mental internal friction.\" Life Palace Tan Lang/Po Jun (change type) burnout usually from \"repetitive work not satisfying desire.\" Life Palace Tian Tong/Tian Liang (stable type) burnout usually from \"forced to do disliked things, losing comfort zone.\" Adjustment methods during burnout: first, \"identify signals\"—persistent insomnia, loss of interest in work, unexplained physical discomfort are warnings, do not force through. Second, \"energy replenishment\"—the domain corresponding to Fortune Palace (hobbies, rest, socializing, spiritual pursuits) needs active time investment, cannot wait until free time to rest. Third, \"work restructuring\"—if burnout comes from the work itself, consider adjusting direction during Decade/Annual transition periods (changing roles, career switching, reducing workload). Fourth, \"seek support\"—Fortune Palace also represents spiritual sustenance; people with faith, hobbies, close friends recover more easily from burnout.",
  "cnA": "实际案例：命宫紫微、官禄宫化权的人，在职场上往往是强势的管理者，但如果福德宫有化忌，容易因为压力过大而 burnout。关键不是「要不要强势」，而是「在什么场景强势」——工作决策上果断，人际关系上柔软。",
  "enA": "Practical case: Someone with Zi Wei in Life Palace and Authority in Career Palace is often a strong manager, but if Fortune Palace has Jealousy, they easily burn out from stress. The key is not \"whether to be strong\" but \"in what scenario to be strong\"—decisive in work decisions, flexible in relationships.",
