  "cat": "yingyong",
  "slug": "ziwei-yuancheng-bangong-minggong-qianyi",
  "focus": "远程办公适配度：命宫与迁移宫的组合。重点讲哪些命盘结构适合远程办公、哪些需要办公室环境，以及远程办公中的自我管理方法。",
  "focusEn": "Remote work compatibility: combinations of Life and Migration palaces. This covers which chart structures suit remote work, which need office environments, and self-management methods for remote work.",
  "cnT": "紫微斗数看远程办公适配：命宫迁移宫组合与居家工作的自我管理",
  "enT": "Remote Work Compatibility in Zi Wei Dou Shu: Life and Migration Palace Combinations",
  "cnD": "远程办公已经成为很多人的工作常态，但不是所有人都适合。从命盘看，远程办公的适配度和命宫（自我管理能力）与迁移宫（外出/公域能量）的组合有关——有些人在家效率更高，有些人必须在办公室才能进入状态。",
  "enD": "Remote work has become the norm for many, but not everyone suits it. From the chart perspective, remote work compatibility relates to the combination of Life Palace (self-management ability) and Migration Palace (outward/public energy)—some are more efficient at home, others can only get into gear in an office.",
  "cnL": "适合远程办公的命盘结构：第一，命宫有天府、天相、太阴等「自律型」星曜——自我管理能力强，不需要外部监督也能按计划完成工作。第二，迁移宫有吉星（化禄、化科、天魁、天钺）但命宫也不弱——既能独立工作，又能通过线上方式获得外部资源和认可。第三，命宫有地空地劫——不喜欢被约束，远程办公的自由度反而能激发创造力。第四，福德宫状态好——内在满足感强，不需要通过办公室社交来获得能量。需要办公室环境的命盘结构：第一，命宫有太阳、廉贞、贪狼等「外放型」星曜——需要人群和互动来激发能量，独自在家容易萎靡。第二，迁移宫弱或有煞星——外出/公域能量不足，远程办公时和外界的连接容易出问题（沟通不畅、被忽略）。第三，命宫有天同——容易拖延、需要外部压力驱动，在家效率低下。第四，交友宫状态好但命宫弱——能量来源是人际关系，脱离团队后失去动力。远程办公的自我管理方法：对于「自律型」的人，关键是「建立仪式感」——固定的工作时间、专门的工作区域、上下班的过渡仪式，避免工作和生活边界模糊。对于「外放型」的人，关键是「主动创造互动」——定期线上会议、视频通话、线下 coworking，不要完全孤立。对于「拖延型」的人，关键是「外部问责机制」——和同事约定进度、使用任务管理工具、设定公开的deadline。通用建议：远程办公不是「更轻松」，而是「把管理自己的责任从公司转移到个人」。命宫强的人能享受这种自由，命宫弱的人需要主动搭建外部结构来替代办公室的监督。",
  "enL": "Chart structures suitable for remote work: first, Life Palace has self-disciplined stars like Tian Fu, Tian Xiang, Tai Yin—strong self-management, can complete work on schedule without external supervision. Second, Migration Palace has auspicious stars (Prosperity, Recognition, Tian Kui, Tian Yue) while Life Palace is also strong—can work independently and obtain external resources and recognition online. Third, Life Palace has Di Kong/Di Jie—dislikes constraints, remote work freedom actually stimulates creativity. Fourth, Fortune Palace is in good condition—strong inner fulfillment, does not need office socializing to gain energy. Chart structures needing office environment: first, Life Palace has outgoing stars like Tai Yang, Lian Zhen, Tan Lang—need crowds and interaction to stimulate energy, easily萎靡 alone at home. Second, Migration Palace is weak or has malefics—insufficient outward/public energy, remote work easily causes connection problems with the outside (poor communication, being overlooked). Third, Life Palace has Tian Tong—prone to procrastination, needs external pressure, low efficiency at home. Fourth, Friends Palace is good but Life Palace is weak—energy source is relationships, loses motivation after脱离 team. Self-management methods for remote work: for \"self-disciplined\" types, the key is \"building ritual\"—fixed work hours, dedicated work area, transition rituals between work and life, avoid blurring boundaries. For \"outgoing\" types, the key is \"actively creating interaction\"—regular online meetings, video calls, offline coworking, do not isolate completely. For \"procrastinating\" types, the key is \"external accountability\"—agree on progress with colleagues, use task management tools, set public deadlines. General advice: remote work is not \"easier\" but \"shifting the responsibility of self-management from the company to the individual.\" Those with strong Life Palace can enjoy this freedom; those with weak Life Palace need to actively build external structures to replace office supervision.",
  "cnA": "实际案例：命宫紫微、官禄宫化权的人，在职场上往往是强势的管理者，但如果福德宫有化忌，容易因为压力过大而 burnout。关键不是「要不要强势」，而是「在什么场景强势」——工作决策上果断，人际关系上柔软。",
  "enA": "Practical case: Someone with Zi Wei in Life Palace and Authority in Career Palace is often a strong manager, but if Fortune Palace has Jealousy, they easily burn out from stress. The key is not \"whether to be strong\" but \"in what scenario to be strong\"—decisive in work decisions, flexible in relationships.",
