  "cnL": "父母宫和上司关系的对应：父母宫有吉星（紫微、天府、天相、化禄、化科）——和权威人物关系好，容易得到上级赏识和提拔，适合在有明确层级的组织中发展。父母宫有煞星（擎羊、陀罗、火星、铃星）——和权威人物容易冲突，不服管、顶撞上级，适合扁平化管理或自己做老板。父母宫化忌——和上级关系是长期课题，容易遇到严苛的上司，或者在权威面前感到压力。父母宫空宫或无主星——对权威的态度不稳定，有时依赖有时反抗，需要看对宫（疾厄宫）的星曜。不同星曜组合的上下级模式：父母宫紫微——上司是强势型，需要被尊重，和这种上司相处要「给足面子但不卑不亢」。父母宫天机——上司是多变型，决策反复，需要「主动确认、留书面记录」。父母宫太阳——上司是开明型，喜欢有活力的下属，适合「主动表现、多沟通」。父母宫太阴——上司是细腻型，注重细节和情绪，需要「做事周到、关注感受」。父母宫武曲——上司是务实型，只看结果，需要「用数据和成果说话」。父母宫天同——上司是随和型，关系容易像朋友，但也要注意保持职业边界。改善和上司关系的方法：第一，「识别上司的类型」——根据父母宫的星曜，判断自己容易遇到什么类型的上司，以及自己的反应模式。第二，「调整沟通方式」——不是所有上司都吃同一套，对上强势型要讲逻辑和尊重，对细腻型要讲感受和细节。第三，「管理预期」——父母宫化忌的人，不要期待上司完美，把注意力放在「从上司那里学到什么」而不是「上司好不好」。第四，「如果实在合不来」——大限流年父母宫有煞星引动时，是换上级或换工作的窗口期。",
  "enL": "Correspondence between Parents Palace and superior relations: Parents Palace has auspicious stars (Zi Wei, Tian Fu, Tian Xiang, Prosperity, Recognition)—good relations with authority, easily appreciated and promoted by superiors, suitable for organizations with clear hierarchy. Parents Palace has malefics (Qing Yang, Tuo Lo, Huo Xing, Ling Xing)—easily conflicts with authority, resents being managed, talks back to superiors, suitable for flat management or being ones own boss. Parents Palace Jealousy—relations with superiors are a long-term lesson, easily encounters harsh superiors or feels pressure in front of authority. Parents Palace empty or no major star—unstable attitude toward authority, sometimes dependent sometimes rebellious, need to look at the opposite palace (Health Palace) stars. Superior-subordinate patterns by star combination: Parents Palace Zi Wei—boss is dominant type, needs respect,相处 with this boss requires \"give face but neither humble nor pushy.\" Parents Palace Ji Ji—boss is variable type, decisions反复, need \"proactively confirm, keep written records.\" Parents Palace Tai Yang—boss is open type, likes energetic subordinates, suitable for \"proactively show, communicate more.\" Parents Palace Tai Yin—boss is delicate type, values details and emotions, need \"be thorough, pay attention to feelings.\" Parents Palace Wu Qu—boss is pragmatic type, only looks at results, need \"speak with data and outcomes.\" Parents Palace Tian Tong—boss is easygoing type, relationship easily like friends, but also maintain professional boundaries. Methods to improve superior relations: first, \"identify boss type\"—based on Parents Palace stars, determine what type of boss you easily encounter and your own reaction pattern. Second, \"adjust communication style\"—not all bosses respond to the same approach; to dominant bosses speak logic and respect, to delicate bosses speak feelings and details. Third, \"manage expectations\"—those with Parents Palace Jealousy should not expect a perfect boss, focus on \"what can I learn from this boss\" not \"is this boss good.\" Fourth, \"if really cannot get along\"—when Decade/Annual Parents Palace has malefic activation, it is a window period for changing bosses or jobs.",
  "cnA": "实际案例：命宫紫微、官禄宫化权的人，在职场上往往是强势的管理者，但如果福德宫有化忌，容易因为压力过大而 burnout。关键不是「要不要强势」，而是「在什么场景强势」——工作决策上果断，人际关系上柔软。",
